# Limits
- This is not an attestation that `cognate create` was deterministic or idempotent;
  that property (PE-02 "reproducible dependency closure") is evidenced only in the
  sense that the closure is pinned to vendored 0.6.1 tarballs and bun.lock is committed.
- Re-running `cognate create` was NOT performed; doing so could silently overwrite
  Horizon composition code, so it is deliberately out of scope for T04 settlement.
- `domain/` is a directory symlink to `.sea/interaction`, so the Cognate semantic entry
  `domain/interaction-model.sea` resolves to the canonical `.sea` source. The symlink's
  portability on other checkouts is a known open question, not a proven property here.
- Executed evidence for this task is in the sibling logs (just-*.log, teeth-*.log);
  this file only records the scaffold's static shape.
